{"id":"vod_sn_37532","vodId":"37532","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"阿尔蒂","name_cn":"阿尔蒂","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/83549c8e384f7ba4ba1e1d5da544ff6d.jpg"},"summary":"故事开始于16世纪的佛罗伦萨，阿尔蒂（小松未可子 配音）是一位出生在贵族家庭的少女，性格开朗的她对这个世界充满了好奇，从很小的时候起，阿尔蒂就深深的沉迷于绘画无法自拔，立志成为一名画家，可是，在那个年代，一位女性想要成为画家简直就是天方夜谭。　　虽然母亲强烈反对阿尔蒂的决定，但阿尔蒂还是坚持了自己的梦想，她找到了当时著名的画家雷欧（小西克幸 配音），请求进入他的艺术工作室学习。虽然刚开始雷欧并不准备接受这个看上去有些憨的少女，但在阿尔蒂的身上，雷欧看到了自己曾经充满了热情的模样，就这样，阿尔蒂正式的成为了雷欧的徒弟，开始了她的绘画之路。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S4MEqqdJxf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eBfi642fLG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dVNwmUfh5D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jWgAFTcxB51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nNdASsKqiR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/63dAv6QdBf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2pN9FWD40A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zv9qHw3b6M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vgdM0WqTA71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sr8hYNJgLM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jr88NKVfg41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sYNhugccJR1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:09.632Z"}